\description{
Returns the single-stage \code{d}/\code{p}/\code{q} functions, each of \verb{(x_or_p, lambda, alpha)}, for a baseline lifetime distribution. Useful for exploring a
distribution in isolation from the two-stage step-stress structure. In every
